- Various bugfixes
- More consistent tpying in code, but now it adds bugs (or at least error messages :-( )
- Started adding tests (TBD + WIP)
- Started adding notebooks folder - placeholder code now, the todo is some sort of google collab applets.
- Modified assembely workflow: penguin is NOT on by default, and Spades uses less kmers.


